      "id": "LEV.14.44",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.44",
      "verse": 44,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the priest shall come and look; and behold, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "if",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the plague is spread in the house, it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a fretting leprosy in the house: it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.45",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.45",
      "verse": 45,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he shall break down the house, its stones, and its timber, and all the mortar of the house: and he shall carry ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " forth out of the city to an unclean place.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.46",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.46",
      "verse": 46,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Moreover, he that goeth into the house all the while that it is shut up, shall be unclean until the evening.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.47",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.47",
      "verse": 47,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he that lieth in the house shall wash his clothes: and he that eateth in the house shall wash his clothes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.48",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.48",
      "verse": 48,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if the priest shall come in, and look ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "upon it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and behold, the plague hath not spread in the house, after the house was plastered: then the priest shall pronounce the house clean, because the plague is healed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.49",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.49",
      "verse": 49,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he shall take to cleanse the house two birds, and cedar-wood, and scarlet, and hyssop:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.50",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.50",
      "verse": 50,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he shall kill one of the birds in an earthen vessel, over running water:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.51",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.51",
      "verse": 51,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he shall take the cedar-wood, and the hyssop, and the scarlet, and the living bird, and dip them in the blood of the slain bird, and in the running water, and sprinkle the house seven times:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.52",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.52",
      "verse": 52,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he shall cleanse the house with the blood of the bird, and with the running water, and with the living bird, and with the cedar wood, and with the hyssop, and with the scarlet:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.53",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.53",
      "verse": 53,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But he shall let go the living bird out of the city into the open fields, and make an atonement for the house: and it shall be clean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.54",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.54",
      "verse": 54,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the law for all manner of plague of leprosy, and scall,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.55",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.55",
      "verse": 55,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And for the leprosy of a garment, and of a house,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.56",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.56",
      "verse": 56,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And for a rising, and for a scab, and for a bright spot:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.14.57",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.14.57",
      "verse": 57,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To teach when ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unclean, and when ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " clean: this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the law of leprosy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
